      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Bay%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A 1907 Illinois Central Railroad branch ran through Red Bay, turning the town into a key lumber and shipping hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        9
