      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Bay%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Garden Club trees planted in the 1930s now drape Main Street, creating a natural canopy over the historic downtown.",
